2026-08-14  CAMouflage 0.4.0

	* Fix: the status item's click monitor swallowed Command-held
	  mouse-downs on the menu bar icon, blocking the system's
	  built-in Command-drag repositioning. Command-held clicks now
	  pass through to the button untouched.

2026-08-12  CAMouflage 0.1.0 (proof of concept)

	* Simulator-side library: +load swizzling of AVCaptureDevice
	  discovery/authorization, AVCaptureDeviceInput,
	  AVCaptureSession lifecycle, AVCaptureVideoDataOutput, and
	  AVCaptureVideoPreviewLayer (hosted AVSampleBufferDisplayLayer).
	* Transport: NDJSON control plane on /tmp/camouflage.sock,
	  length-prefixed binary JPEG frame plane on
	  /tmp/camouflage-frames.sock (32-byte little-endian header).
	* CAMouflage-Mac menu bar app: Off/Mock modes (Passthrough
	  stubbed), fixtures for SMPTE-style test pattern with timestamp
	  burn-in, static image, and looping movie; live fixture
	  switching; persisted state.
	* SampleApp (xcodegen) demonstrating preview + frame delivery.
	* Validated end-to-end in the iOS Simulator with all three
	  fixture types.
